Reason: wiiu: endian-06 (SPC byte-code immediates) and endian-05 (.prm parameter values) byte-reverse under TARGET_PC, which the Wii U also defines; on big-endian Espresso they scrambled script values (TSpcInterp::execcall stored to 0xFFFDFFF8). Little-endian hosts only.
